{"unit_id":"tag:08JH:proof","translation":"选择拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0001>，其目标为 K-内射（injective）复形（complex）。设 <MATH_0002> 为复形（complex），其各项（terms）为\n<MATH_0003>，\n它表示 <MATH_0004>，由第 <REF_0001> 节的构造。只需证明映射（map）\n<MATH_0005>\n为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）。给定对象（object）<MATH_0006>，属于 <MATH_0007>，直接检验得到\n<MATH_0008>。\n由引理 <REF_0002>，以下的层化（sheafification）\n<MATH_0009>\n等于以下的层化（sheafification）\n<MATH_0010>。\n对其他上同调层（cohomology sheaves）可作类似论证。因此，<MATH_0011> 与 <MATH_0012> 拟同构（quasi-isomorphic），从而证明了引理。\n","allowed_english":["K-"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"各项"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphic","target_term":"拟同构"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"内射替换与比较"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"K-内射条件"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"内部 Hom 代表"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"各项","context":"显式代表"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"两个代表的比较"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"逐对象检验"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"同伦类的局部比较"},{"source_term":"cohomology sheaves","target_term":"上同调层","context":"拟同构检验"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphic","target_term":"拟同构","context":"代表的等价"}],"notes":["K-前缀与内射（injective）共同表达 K-injective。"]}
